    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a doctor in the town of Stagmarch, where an otherworldly illness is mutating residents. Get to know your patients, diagnose their illnesses, and treat them. However, you have limited medicine, and every day your patients get worse. How far will you go to save others?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET THE PATIENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/055ff4a783e694d2db977f617bc10ac6.avif?t=1746473494\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/fe7a5c838c52cb3d10e92590d1156e58.avif?t=1746473494\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/1bed78e58007670a6e521bc6fe88f9aa.avif?t=1746473494\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO YOU SAVE MATTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/f7a5459fd818ccfce3d55321bba50986.poster.avif?t=1746473494\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/f7a5459fd818ccfce3d55321bba50986.webm?t=1746473494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/f7a5459fd818ccfce3d55321bba50986.mp4?t=1746473494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your patients all hold important roles in Stagmarch, and the town will feel their absence. More than just their fates rest in your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU CANNOT SAVE EVERYONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/5c89c13d4098a0c1b3ee754a71d501fd.poster.avif?t=1746473494\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/5c89c13d4098a0c1b3ee754a71d501fd.webm?t=1746473494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/5c89c13d4098a0c1b3ee754a71d501fd.mp4?t=1746473494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's not enough medicine to go around, and as the only doctor you'll have to decide who gets treated and who gets left behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEARN ABOUT YOUR PATIENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/3bfd04fecd3c7532c87c28da6dc61db4.poster.avif?t=1746473494\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/3bfd04fecd3c7532c87c28da6dc61db4.webm?t=1746473494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/3bfd04fecd3c7532c87c28da6dc61db4.mp4?t=1746473494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout 3 days of work at the town's clinic, get to know your patients. Find out who they really are.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> CRAFTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/2afedfd72225273ef0d722beba82c288.poster.avif?t=1746473494\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/2afedfd72225273ef0d722beba82c288.webm?t=1746473494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/2afedfd72225273ef0d722beba82c288.mp4?t=1746473494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To treat the sick, harvest herbs from the clinic\u2019s garden and make your own medicines from them. Refer to the prior doctor\u2019s notes if you need to, because if you screw it up you could make things worse...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE ATMOSPHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/5a7ef90d93527d0246cf6333762e4025.poster.avif?t=1746473494\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/5a7ef90d93527d0246cf6333762e4025.webm?t=1746473494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/5a7ef90d93527d0246cf6333762e4025.mp4?t=1746473494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mansion turned clinic, discover what sort of secrets linger within these halls\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triage features many endings, all different varieties of bad!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triage was developed over the course of 1 academic year as part of the Champlain College Game Studio capstone project.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a doctor in the town of Stagmarch, where an otherworldly illness is mutating residents. Get to know your patients, diagnose their illnesses, and treat them. However, you have limited medicine, and every day your patients get worse. How far will you go to save others?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET THE PATIENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/055ff4a783e694d2db977f617bc10ac6.avif?t=1746473494\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/fe7a5c838c52cb3d10e92590d1156e58.avif?t=1746473494\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/1bed78e58007670a6e521bc6fe88f9aa.avif?t=1746473494\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO YOU SAVE MATTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/f7a5459fd818ccfce3d55321bba50986.poster.avif?t=1746473494\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/f7a5459fd818ccfce3d55321bba50986.webm?t=1746473494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/f7a5459fd818ccfce3d55321bba50986.mp4?t=1746473494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your patients all hold important